@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
participant UI
participant LogicManager
participant DeleteCommand
participant PendingRequest
participant Model
participant Storage
UI -> LogicManager : execute("delete 1")
LogicManager -> Model : capture ModelSnapshot
LogicManager -> DeleteCommand : execute(model)
DeleteCommand -> Model : resolve displayed contact
DeleteCommand --> LogicManager : CommandResult with ConfirmationRequest
LogicManager --> UI : preview (no mutation or save)
UI -> LogicManager : execute("y")
LogicManager -> PendingRequest : respond("y", model)
PendingRequest -> Model : delete retained target; restore full list
PendingRequest --> LogicManager : completed result
LogicManager -> Storage : atomically save changed data
Storage --> LogicManager : saved
LogicManager --> UI : deleted details and remaining count
note over LogicManager, Model : n/cancel restores original view; save failure restores snapshot.
@enduml
